# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so text files are checked out as CRLF.
# 'build tracker.html' is generated from fyp_build_tracker.jsx by build_tracker_html.py,
# and tests/test_tracker_sync.py compares the two by raw bytes. Without pinning these to
# LF, a fresh clone on Windows checks them out as CRLF, the generator rewrites them as LF,
# and test_generator_is_idempotent fails on a clean checkout for no real reason.
*.jsx   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
